.quarto/
/_site/
/fonts/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
.Rproj.user

/.luarc.json

/.quarto/
OLD CVS/

# Private contact details for the application CVs — phone, email, location, birth. The
# repo is public: this file must never be committed. _cv-private.example.yml is its
# template, and is tracked on purpose — do not list it here. A .gitignore entry has no
# effect on a file git already tracks, so listing it would only hide it from a fresh
# clone if it were ever untracked; real details belong in _cv-private.yml, never in it.
/_cv-private.yml
# Quarto's intermediate Typst source for a CV, which carries those same details if a
# failed render leaves it behind. The style file is the only .typ that is source.
/cv/*.typ
!/cv/_typst-style.typ
